            # For calc/mosaic/stack/concat, standalone positionals are input(s) ... output. We can append temp output at end if user tokens contain no output positional - but they may contain options ending with an input positional.
            # We'll parse step tokens with step specs to identify extra positional args, then build synthetic from parsed values in _invoke_via_serialized.
            return self._invoke_via_serialized(node,args,expected_kind,generation=True)
